N2  -  The validation of product properties is a necessary part of the product development process. Consequently, methods and models used there for have to be validated itself in order to produce reliable results. This paper describes and exemplarily implements a process model that integrates model validation into product development. The CPM/PDD approach according to Weber (2005) provides the basic process model and the modeling procedure is based on VDI 2006 (2004) and ASME V&V 10 (2006). The focus of the introduced process model is on continuous integration, consistency of data and knowledge storage. © 2018 Faculty of Mechanical Engineering and Naval Architecture. All rights reserved.

