N2  -  This paper presents a methodology for incorporating dynamic transport times into semiconductor production planning. This enables more accurate production process modeling by accounting for dynamic system effects, thereby improving prediction precision. The paper introduces a dynamic correction factor to propose a combined production- and logistics-simulation model that produces realistic results while maintaining the computational efficiency of pure production simulation models. We call our model "LogiFabSim"- holistic Logistics and Fab Simulation. © 2025 The Authors. This is an open access article under the CC BY-NC-ND license.

